{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>TVB戀愛真人騷《女神配對計劃2》迎來高潮，2023年港姐五強郭珮文與前男友Ice於水族館過夜環節進行深夜對話。面對男方早前與其他女參加者過從甚密引發信任危機，男方突然給出深情承諾。女方聽畢後的真實反應及最終決定，直接令大批觀眾感到極度震驚。</p>\n<h2><b><strong>昔日因「Long D」分手 男方早前因缺「邊界感」惹禍</strong></b></h2>\n<p>回顧兩人的感情背景，Juliana與Ice昔日曾有一段情，但最終因難以維繫「Long D」（異地戀）而遺憾分手。今次兩人在《女神配對計劃2》再度碰頭，本以為有機會破鏡重圓，惟早前Ice在節目遊戲環節中，與另一女嘉賓陳星妤出現親密肢體接觸，令Juliana當場呷醋，事件亦引發網民熱議，狠批Ice對其他異性欠缺「邊界感」。</p>\n<h2><b><strong>水族館過夜真心話 Ice承諾改變即融化舊愛</strong></b></h2>\n<p>在最新播出的水族館浪漫過夜環節中，兩人趁著靜謐氣氛展開一場深夜真心話。面對Juliana坦承自己在感情中一直缺乏安全感，Ice隨即趁機為早前與陳星妤的互動再次解畫。起初仍帶點委屈及保持距離的Juliana，語帶無奈地表示：「我沒資格說你們甚麼……」見舊愛依然介懷，Ice即發揮甜言蜜語攻勢，向Juliana許下深情承諾，聲稱未來會為她作出改變，從此不想再讓她承受這種難受的感覺。這番說話瞬間擊中Juliana的軟肋，令她防線全面崩潰。她在事後接受訪問時更難掩內心喜悅，一臉甜笑地表示：「我其實係好開心嘅。之前因為呢啲問題我哋都磨合咗好耐，但係佢而家好似真係有想改變嘅心，我係好開心嘅。」</p>\n<h2><b><strong>網民質疑男方「得個吹字」 痛心Ju姿態太低</strong></b></h2>\n<p>雖然節目畫面充滿粉紅泡泡，兩人看似迎來復合曙光，但一眾網民卻並不受落，更對Juliana極速原諒對方的舉動大感痛心。不少網民在討論區留言質疑Ice的承諾只是「空頭支票」，狠批：「佢都係得個吹字」，認為男方欠缺邊界感是本性難移。同時，大批粉絲對Juliana太容易心軟「沉船」感到恨鐵不成鋼，紛紛留言勸諫：「唔好人地講兩句你又沉番」、「Ju值得更好」、「唔明點解要咁低姿態去就條仔，佢完全畀Ice食住」。更有網民一針見血指出，兩人當初分手的死穴「Long D」問題至今仍未解決，單靠幾句承諾根本無補於事。雖然有網民無奈笑言「真係冇得救，快啲一齊返」、「你哋鎖死吧」，但更多人依然希望Juliana能保持清醒，切勿在愛情中將姿態放得太低。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480030192587546_15835785576afa7aae50bc7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"J7.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480030192587546_15835785576afa7aae50bc7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948003032629017_5451480866afa7aafe8b84.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"J3.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/17948003032629017_5451480866afa7aafe8b84.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480030566734479_6493498446afa7ab204bcd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"J1_0.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480030566734479_6493498446afa7ab204bcd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480030740939111_14492723166afa7ab3dfbc0.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"J9.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480030740939111_14492723166afa7ab3dfbc0.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480031068183870_9497234276afa7ab71ec7c.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"J5.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179480031068183870_9497234276afa7ab71ec7c.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-16T03:51:52.266884+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1235,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-16T03:38:37+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-16T04:05:36.322368+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-16T03:45:20.709355+00:00","content_hash":"b93e06f09f01c79bce3d7b9f21f5a3aacc6a2d16203863b91374c18ffb6faa48","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}